<title>USA: First of America Bank Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>First of America Bank Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.32		    $0.94</p>
<p> Net			 79,400		   59,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,106		   63,548</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net includes after-tax gains from branch sales of $13.1 million and severance charges of $2.6 million. Q1 1996 net includes gains from branch sales of $2.7 million.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating profit $69.0 million or $1.15 a share vs $56.9 million or $0.90 a share.  </p>
<p>Q1 1997 net interest income $220.6 million vs $226.4 million. Q1 total non-interest revenue $127.0 million vs $94.2 million.</p>
<p>Assets $21.47 billion vs $22.72 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $17.11 billion vs $18.40 billion</p>
<p>Net Loans $14.48 billion vs $15.49 billion</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
